## Key Design Decisions

- Portfolio optimizer reuses existing calc engines (Kelly, Monte Carlo, power-law) — no new math
- Asset class database is static JSON, not computed — changes slowly, curated manually
- Search Rewriter produces queries, does NOT execute them — LLM still runs WebSearch
- Backward compatible: old verdicts without portfolio still score, just miss bonus points
- Max score stays 180 (redistribute, don't increase) to avoid grade threshold cascade
